{"seq":2,"slug":"attack-lifecycle-bustout","title":"攻击生命周期与 bust-out 剧本：first-party vs third-party 欺诈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/synthetic-identity-taxonomy/attack-lifecycle-bustout","wordCount":2941,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"攻击生命周期与-bust-out-剧本-first-party-vs-third-party-欺诈\">攻击生命周期与 bust-out 剧本：first-party vs third-party 欺诈</h1><p>一笔坏账到底该记在「欺诈」还是「信用损失」科目下，决定的不只是财务报表，还决定风控团队能否看到它。拒付（chargeback）会进入欺诈统计，而一位真实客户用真名开了账户、刷满额度后消失，通常只被记为坏账核销（charge-off）——同一笔经济损失就这样在两个口径下消失。理解 first-party（第一方，FPF）、third-party（第三方，TPF）与合成身份（synthetic identity fraud，SIF）三条链条的生命周期差异，是把图检测信号对准正确阶段的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三分法与定义困境\">核心概念：三分法与定义困境</h2><p>行业惯用的三分法沿两条轴切分：<strong>身份归属</strong>（谁在用）与<strong>还款意图</strong>（是否打算还）。第三方欺诈里身份是真的、意图恶意；第一方欺诈里两者都由本人掌控、只是不打算还；合成身份欺诈占据第三象限——一个由碎片拼出的、从未真实存在过的「人」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Third-party (TPF)</th>\n<th>First-party (FPF)</th>\n<th>Synthetic (SIF)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>身份真实性</td>\n<td>真实（被盗用）</td>\n<td>真实（本人）</td>\n<td>拼装/伪造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用者与身份主体</td>\n<td>不一致</td>\n<td>一致</td>\n<td>身份主体不存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型损失口径</td>\n<td>欺诈损失（chargeback）</td>\n<td>信用损失（charge-off）</td>\n<td>混合，取决于发卡方记账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次损失时点</td>\n<td>立即（开卡即刷）</td>\n<td>长期（seasoning 后）</td>\n<td>最长（建立信用史后）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要受害方</td>\n<td>身份主体 + 商户</td>\n<td>发卡行/商户/平台</td>\n<td>发卡行 + 平台 + 后续查询方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键阻断阶段</td>\n<td>登录/授权</td>\n<td>额度爬升</td>\n<td>开户/身份核验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>定义困境在于 <strong>FPF 的隐藏性</strong>。发卡机构通常不把「本人明知故犯」标注为欺诈，因为证明意图与 Reg E / Reg Z 的举证成本高，于是当作普通拖欠核销。这使公开统计里 FPF 系统性偏低：Federal Reserve 的支付系统合成身份欺诈研究（SIRA，2021）之所以单独拆分 SIF，正是因为它在传统 chargeback 报表里被信贷损失吞掉了。对图检测团队，这意味着<strong>训练标签本身有偏</strong>——正样本偏向 TPF，SIF/FPF 混在「正常客户」里，模型会低估后两类。</p>\n<p>三条链条最终在 <strong>bust-out</strong>（一次性榨干后弃用）这个动作上汇合——这是本 hub 与 <a href=\"../identity-graph-resolution/\">身份图谱与解析</a> 章节的衔接点：无论身份怎么来，变现留下的图结构痕迹高度相似。</p>\n<h2 id=\"攻击生命周期七阶段\">攻击生命周期七阶段</h2><p>三条链条摊平到时间轴上，呈现一个共用的七阶段结构；差异只在于各阶段的<strong>时长</strong>与<strong>强度</strong>，而非种类。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S1[1 身份构造&lt;br/&gt;拼装 PII / 盗取凭证 / 真实本人] --&gt; S2[2 入口办理&lt;br/&gt;开户 / 下单 / 注册卖家]&#10;  S2 --&gt; S3[3 静默培育 seasoning&lt;br/&gt;按时还款 / 小额真实交易 / 积累好评]&#10;  S3 --&gt; S4[4 额度与信任爬升&lt;br/&gt;提额 / 提高授信 / 免预授权]&#10;  S4 --&gt; S5[5 触发条件成熟&lt;br/&gt;额度上限 / 节假日窗口 / 团伙就位]&#10;  S5 --&gt; S6[6 集中变现 bust-out&lt;br/&gt;瞬时刷满 / 虚假交易 / 提现]&#10;  S6 --&gt; S7[7 弃用与迁移&lt;br/&gt;失联 / 换号 / 复制到新身份]&#10;  S7 --&gt; S1\">flowchart TD\n  S1[1 身份构造&lt;br/&gt;拼装 PII / 盗取凭证 / 真实本人] --&gt; S2[2 入口办理&lt;br/&gt;开户 / 下单 / 注册卖家]\n  S2 --&gt; S3[3 静默培育 seasoning&lt;br/&gt;按时还款 / 小额真实交易 / 积累好评]\n  S3 --&gt; S4[4 额度与信任爬升&lt;br/&gt;提额 / 提高授信 / 免预授权]\n  S4 --&gt; S5[5 触发条件成熟&lt;br/&gt;额度上限 / 节假日窗口 / 团伙就位]\n  S5 --&gt; S6[6 集中变现 bust-out&lt;br/&gt;瞬时刷满 / 虚假交易 / 提现]\n  S6 --&gt; S7[7 弃用与迁移&lt;br/&gt;失联 / 换号 / 复制到新身份]\n  S7 --&gt; S1</pre><p>各阶段的工程含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>阶段 1–2（构造与入口）</strong> 是唯一能在损失发生前以低成本阻断的窗口，信号大多是<strong>静态属性一致性</strong>：SSN 与姓名/生日的组合是否出现在公开数据、age-to-SSN 发行年份是否矛盾、地址是否为转运仓（mail drop）、号码是否为非固定 VoIP。2026 年的新难点是生成式模型批量产出的伪造证件与自拍，使传统 OCR + 活体检测边际收益下降，倒逼向<strong>设备指纹 + 行为生物特征 + 图关系</strong>迁移。</li>\n<li><strong>阶段 3（seasoning）</strong> 是 SIF 独有的长周期。攻击者故意做小额真实消费并全额还款让账户看起来「优质」，同时从不兑换积分、不使用会暴露真实身份的服务。检测思路不是找异常，而是找<strong>反常的正常</strong>——过度规律的还款、零权益兑换率、品类极度集中。</li>\n<li><strong>阶段 5–6（触发与 bust-out）</strong> 的图论特征是<strong>同步性</strong>：团伙控制的多个账户在同一时间窗（常见 24–72 小时）内同时达到利用率上限，单账户每项都合规，跨账户的时间相关性才暴露它。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"first-party-欺诈-自有身份-无还款意图\">First-party 欺诈：自有身份、无还款意图</h2><p>FPF 在电商与支付场景下有一组独立剧本，识别它们不能复用 TPF 的信号。<strong>信用卡 bust-out</strong> 是最经典的形态：持卡人以真实身份开卡，按最低还款维持 12–18 个月，期间主动申请提额，然后在额度到顶时一次性刷满并停止还款。历史上发卡行把这类损失计入信贷损失，但 2020 年代后期多家机构（如 LexisNexis Risk Solutions《True Cost of Fraud》年度研究、Javelin Strategy &amp; Research 欺诈报告）开始在伪冒统计中显式拆分 FPF，原因正是它对<strong>准入模型</strong>的污染：若 FPF 被当作正常履约客户喂进模型，模型会学到「长期按时还款 = 低风险」而漏掉蓄意违约者。电商侧的剧本更为多样：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>剧本</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>关键信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BNPL 首期违约</td>\n<td>首付后失联</td>\n<td>设备/地址与历史拒付簇重合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INR 滥用（item not received）</td>\n<td>谎报未收货发起拒付</td>\n<td>高客诉率 + 收货地址非自用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空盒/换货欺诈</td>\n<td>退回空盒或他物</td>\n<td>退货率、退货商品重量异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>促销滥用</td>\n<td>多账号薅新人券</td>\n<td>设备/银行卡/收货点多账号共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家 bust-out</td>\n<td>刷好评养号后收钱不发货</td>\n<td>好评速度、发货时效骤降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>卖家侧 bust-out 是跨境电商特有的高损失形态：团伙注册多个店铺，前期用低价真实订单与刷单把评分做起来，触发平台流量加权后集中接单收款、延迟发货直至关店跑路。由于平台通常在 T+N 结算，攻击者会刻意在<strong>结算周期与纠纷率阈值</strong>之间寻找窗口——这与 <a href=\"../investigation-ops-compliance/\">调查运营与合规</a> 章节的争议处理时序相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"third-party-欺诈-账户接管与合成身份的交汇\">Third-party 欺诈：账户接管与合成身份的交汇</h2><p>TPF 的现代形态以<strong>账户接管（ATO）<strong>为中心：撞库（credential stuffing）或钓鱼获取凭证 → 登录验证绕过 → 修改联系方式/收货地址 → 下单或提现 → 洗白。它的时间尺度是</strong>分钟到小时级</strong>，与 SIF 的月级生命周期形成对比，检测架构也不同：ATO 依赖实时会话信号（设备切换、地理跳变、行为轨迹突变），SIF 依赖跨月行为基线。</p>\n<p>2026 年的结构性变化在于<strong>合成身份与第三方的融合</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>生成式伪造降低门槛</strong>。用 LLM 批量生成自洽的姓名、地址、生日组合，配合图像模型合成证件，使「构造一个可信身份」的边际成本从人工小时级降到自动化秒级，直接压缩阶段 1–2 的检测窗口。</li>\n<li><strong>深度伪造绕过 KYC</strong>。视频活体面对实时换脸（face swap）与注入式攻击（virtual camera injection）时，必须叠加<strong>设备完整性证明 + 被动活体 + 交叉数据源核验</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>mule 账户网络</strong>。变现环节需要可接收资金的「骡子」账户，常由被招募的真人提供（真实身份但受他人控制），使「身份真实」不再等价于「交易可信」。mule 网络的<strong>入金—出金时间差</strong>与<strong>分散聚合结构</strong>在个体层面完全隐形，是图检测价值最高的场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"bust-out-的时序特征与量化检测\">Bust-out 的时序特征与量化检测</h2><p>bust-out 之所以可被图检测捕获，是因为它在时间维度上有<strong>独一无二的形状</strong>：长期低于额度上限的稳定利用率，突然跃迁到上限并保持。设账户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在月份 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的利用率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_{i}(t) = \\mathrm{balance}_{i}(t) / \\mathrm{limit}_{i}(t) \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">balance</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">limit</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，bust-out 账户表现为一次<strong>阶跃</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≫</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta u_i = u_i(t_{\\text{out}}) - u_i(t_{\\text{out}}-1) \\;\\gg\\; 0, \\qquad u_i(t_{\\text{out}}+k) \\approx 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><s