coding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 小（数小时到数天）而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|G|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 大的簇是极强的团伙信号。实践中把同步性、利用率阶跃、seasoning 时长组合成分数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BustOutScore</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BustOutScore}(G) = w_1 \\cdot \\bar{\\Delta u} + w_2 \\cdot \\frac{1}{1+\\sigma_G} + w_3 \\cdot \\bar{m}_G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BustOutScore</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9034em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1574em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7178em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{m}_G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7178em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是团伙平均 seasoning 月数。权重应对照自身历史核销数据拟合而非套用单一机构经验值——这也是 FPF 记账口径影响模型的原因：核销数据没标注意图，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的标签就是噪声。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>生命周期阶段</th>\n<th>可观测信号</th>\n<th>检测范式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>身份构造</td>\n<td>PII 组合不一致、VoIP 号码、mail drop 地址</td>\n<td>静态规则 + 数据源核验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入口办理</td>\n<td>设备指纹复用、注册速度、行为生物特征</td>\n<td>实时风控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静默培育</td>\n<td>零权益兑换、还款过度规律、品类集中</td>\n<td>跨月行为基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信任爬升</td>\n<td>提额请求时间线、授权额度增长</td>\n<td>序列模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集中变现</td>\n<td>利用率阶跃、跨账户时间同步、收款账户共享</td>\n<td>图 + 时序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弃用迁移</td>\n<td>失联、地址失效、关联新账户</td>\n<td>图扩散追踪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"生命周期视角的图检测落点\">生命周期视角的图检测落点</h2><p>把信号映射到阶段后，一个可落地的原则浮现：<strong>图检测的价值随生命周期后移而上升</strong>，因为越靠后的阶段攻击者留下的<strong>关系痕迹</strong>越多，单账户特征越难区分。阶段 1–2 用属性核验与设备指纹，图只是辅助；阶段 3–4 需要<strong>跨月图快照</strong>，看账户与电话、地址、银行账户、收款账户的边如何演化，seasoning 期图相对静止，突变点本身就是信号；阶段 5–6 是图检测主场，同步 bust-out、mule 归集、资金回流路径都是纯图结构，需要能处理<strong>时序异构图</strong>的模型，方法见 <a href=\"../graph-fraud-detection-ml/\">图谱反欺诈检测</a> 章节。</p>\n<p>一个容易被忽略的工程点是<strong>干预窗口的不可逆性</strong>。阶段 6 之后资金已流出，追索成本远高于事前阻断；但过早拦截（阶段 2）会误伤正常新客，尤其跨境电商新客占比高、跨境身份核验数据源稀疏。因此应把阶段 3–5 作为<strong>主要干预带</strong>：此时账户已有足够历史可判定基线，损失尚未发生，代价是系统必须保留长周期图快照与行为特征，而不能只做无状态实时判定。身份构造阶段的拆解见同章节的 <a href=\"../synthetic-identity-taxonomy/synthetic-identity-construction\">合成身份构造</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三分法沿「身份归属 × 还款意图」两轴切分，<strong>定义困境</strong>在于 FPF/SIF 常被记入信用损失而非欺诈损失，训练标签系统性有偏。</li>\n<li>三条链条共用<strong>七阶段生命周期</strong>，差异在时长：TPF 分钟级、FPF 月级蓄意违约、SIF 月到年级；<strong>seasoning</strong> 阶段特征是「过度正常」。</li>\n<li><strong>bust-out 的核心可检测形状是跨账户时间同步性</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与利用率阶跃 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta u_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，单账户合规而群体暴露。</li>\n<li>2026 年的结构性变化是生成式伪造与深度伪造降低身份构造成本，mule 网络让「身份真实」不再等于「交易可信」。</li>\n<li>图检测价值随生命周期后移上升，<strong>主要干预带应设在阶段 3–5</strong>。</li>\n<li>检测落点见 <a href=\"../graph-fraud-detection-ml/\">图谱反欺诈检测</a>，争议与合规处理见 <a href=\"../investigation-ops-compliance/\">调查运营与合规</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参考来源：Federal Reserve《Synthetic Identity Fraud in the U.S. Payment System》(SIRA, 2021)；FinCEN 身份相关可疑活动分析；FTC Consumer Sentinel Network 年报；LexisNexis Risk Solutions《True Cost of Fraud》年度研究；Javelin Strategy &amp; Research 欺诈报告。数值随年份与口径变化，部署前须核对最新原始报告。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"攻击生命周期与 bust-out 剧本：first-party vs third-party 欺诈","id":"攻击生命周期与-bust-out-剧本-first-party-vs-third-party-欺诈"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三分法与定义困境","id":"核心概念-三分法与定义困境"},{"level":2,"text":"攻击生命周期七阶段","id":"攻击生命周期七阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"First-party 欺诈：自有身份、无还款意图","id":"first-party-欺诈-自有身份-无还款意图"},{"level":2,"text":"Third-party 欺诈：账户接管与合成身份的交汇","id":"third-party-欺诈-账户接管与合成身份的交汇"},{"level":2,"text":"Bust-out 的时序特征与量化检测","id":"bust-out-的时序特征与量化检测"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期视角的图检测落点","id":"生命周期视角的图检测落点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合成身份构造建模：拼接身份、伪造证件与信用培育（credit farming）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/synthetic-identity-taxonomy/synthetic-identity-construction"},"next":{"title":"欺诈损失分类与度量口径：申请欺诈、交易欺诈与损失归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/synthetic-identity-taxonomy/fraud-loss-taxonomy-metrics"}}